1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,229
A titration is repeated until the results agree.

2
00:00:03,229 --> 00:00:09,765
The first one is a rough run, done quickly to find the neighbourhood, and it is discarded.

3
00:00:09,765 --> 00:00:16,393
Then careful runs, until two or more agree within zero point one cubic centimetre.

4
00:00:16,393 --> 00:00:20,963
Those are concordant readings, and their mean goes into the calculation.

